  "boxes": [
    {
      "type": "anchorbox",
      "title": "Standing Up to Bullies",
      "description": "Hanuman was inherently peaceful, but when his boundaries were repeatedly broken by toxic forces (Asura), he assumed a terrifying, massive form (Bhima Rupa) to protect his mission. True strength means being gentle by default, but having the courage and ferocity to stand up decisively to bullies and injustice when necessary.",
